{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0130nsanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n galaksiler aras\u0131 geni\u015fleme \u00e7abalar\u0131, isyan eden koloniler, yabanc\u0131 t\u00fcrler ve kontrol edilemeyen g\u00fc\u00e7lerle b\u00fcy\u00fck bir sava\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fc. \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm basit ama ac\u0131mas\u0131z: D\u00fczeni korumak i\u00e7in en iyi sava\u015f\u00e7\u0131lar g\u00f6nderildi. Onlar <strong>The Peacemakers</strong>\u2014bar\u0131\u015f\u0131 sa\u011flamak i\u00e7in sava\u015fan se\u00e7kin bir askeri birlik.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tek ki\u015filik, sinematik bir FPS deneyimi sunan <strong>The Peacemakers</strong>, oyuncular\u0131 \u00e7arp\u0131c\u0131 uzay manzaralar\u0131, tehlikeli gezegenler ve sars\u0131c\u0131 sava\u015flarla dolu derin bir hik\u00e2yenin i\u00e7ine \u00e7ekiyor. Y\u00fcksek teknoloji silahlar, geli\u015fmi\u015f sava\u015f donan\u0131mlar\u0131 ve \u00e7e\u015fitli yard\u0131mc\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131la, d\u00fc\u015fman hatlar\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6tesinde \u00f6l\u00fcmc\u00fcl kararlar vermek zorundas\u0131n\u0131z.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544010?t=1740906692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544010?t=1740906692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544010/fd0d1c4d081ed06256c195454bc26521358bee19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740906692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544010/fd0d1c4d081ed06256c195454bc26521358bee19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740906692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0130nsanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n galaksiler aras\u0131 geni\u015fleme \u00e7abalar\